.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH soundcraft-cli-info 1  "info " 
.SH NAME
soundcraft\-cli\-info \- Print an audio file\*(Aqs format as JSON, or a .scraft session\*(Aqs summary
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsoundcraft\-cli info\fR [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print an audio file\*(Aqs format as JSON, or a .scraft session\*(Aqs summary
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
One line of JSON instead of pretty\-printed (a .scraft summary is text and ignores it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
An audio file (wav, wave, bwf, rf64, aif, aiff, aifc, flac, mp3, mp2, mp1, ogg, oga, m4a, m4b, aac, mp4, adts, caf, mkv, webm) or a .scraft session
